		skos:definition	"Companies engaged in the diversified production or extraction of metals and minerals not classified elsewhere. Including, but not limited to, nonferrous metal mining (except aluminum), salt and borate mining, phosphate rock mining, metallurgical (coking) coal mining used for steel production and diversified mining operations. Excludes iron ore mining, classified in the Steel Sub-Industry and aluminum mining classified in the Aluminum Sub-Industry.  Excludes bituminous (thermal) coal-mining companies classified in the Coal & Consumable Fuels Sub-Industry."@en ;
