This Sub-Industry excludes companies that offer management & technology consulting services to government & defense organizations classified in the Research & Consulting Services Sub-Industry."""@en ;
	skos:notation	"20101010" ;
	tempo:validFrom	"1999-01-01"^^xsd:date .

