		rdfs:label	"Hotels, Resorts & Cruise Lines"@en ;
		skos:definition	"Owners and operators of hotels, resorts and cruise-ships. Includes travel agencies, tour operators and related services not classified elsewhere . Excludes casino-hotels classified in the Casinos & Gaming Sub-Industry."@en ;
