		rdfs:label	"Consumer Finance"@en ;
		skos:definition	"Providers of consumer finance services, including personal credit, credit cards, lease financing, travel-related money services and pawn shops.  Excludes mortgage lenders classified in the Thrifts & Mortgage Finance Sub-Industry."@en ;
